# GambitDarwinAcceleration::stdlibOuterPhaseOwnership
stdlib_front: "Official std/build.ss frontend
Original macro initialization and build specification"
stdlib_join: "Sealed files + scalar native arguments
Frontend joined and process group quiescent"
stdlib_native: "Fresh compiler-output consumer
Exclusive class for unqualified whole-module jobs
Caller worker capacity unchanged"
stdlib_complete: "Unchanged output + native completion
Then full compiler/tools and BOTH package gates"
producer -> stdlib_front -> stdlib_join -> stdlib_native -> stdlib_complete
stdlib_complete -> packages

